-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The copy of the auditor's report: the name of the auditor, or the section 506 resolution (ss 443A(4), (5) and the same in the other sections)
-- The fields of `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report`, in order: more than one auditor; the copy states the name of the auditor; states the names of all the auditors; the auditor is a firm; states the senior statutory auditor; the s 506 answer; states the s 506 resolution.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- one auditor, not a firm, named
`s 443A fixture sole auditor named` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE
-- one auditor, not named, no s 506 resolution possible
`s 443A fixture sole auditor not named` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE
-- a firm, named, but the senior statutory auditor is not
`s 443A fixture firm without senior statutory auditor` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE
-- a firm, named, with the senior statutory auditor
`s 443A fixture firm with senior statutory auditor` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST FALSE, FALSE
-- names omitted, section 506 conditions met, the resolution stated
`s 443A fixture section 506 resolution stated` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, JUST TRUE, TRUE
-- names omitted, section 506 conditions met, but nothing stated
`s 443A fixture section 506 met but nothing stated` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, JUST TRUE, FALSE
-- names omitted, the resolution stated, but whether the section 506 conditions are met is not known
`s 443A fixture section 506 not known with statement` MEANS `s 443A facts about the copy of the auditor's report` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, NOTHING, TRUE
-- names omitted, nothing stated, section 506 not known
