-- The regulative rule: the directors deliver on the last day of the period (day 273): FULFILLED; a day late (day 274): BREACH BY Director; on day 0: FULFILLED.
-- (A DEONTIC value cannot be compared in an #ASSERT; the two traces are read by eye and recorded in NOTES.md,
-- and the decision function above is asserted for the same facts.)
#TRACE `s 441(1) the directors' duty to deliver the accounts and reports` 273 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Registrar, "deliver to the registrar the accounts and reports required by section 443A, 444, 444A, 445, 446 or 447" AT 273
#TRACE `s 441(1) the directors' duty to deliver the accounts and reports` 273 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Registrar, "deliver to the registrar the accounts and reports required by section 443A, 444, 444A, 445, 446 or 447" AT 274
